{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-16",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "舞台恐惧症的秘密  (The Secret of Stage Fright)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "agent": "经纪人",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the hospital, Chun Yuqiao learns that Li Mingji has been revived, yet Li Mingji's manager threatens lawsuits until Yuqiao reveals a long-kept secret from the singer's debut. Listen to their exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你觉得来病房献殷勤，我们就能原谅你吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "李先生现在怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "算你们命大，人救过来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没有制止他胡乱吃药，那是我们的失误。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但这不是他心脏病发的原因。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我们的律师就在医院里等着呢，我们就是要告你们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "李铭基有舞台恐惧症。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你说什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他每次上台之前，你都会偷偷在台脚放一颗宝石。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让他看见宝石，他才会有信心完成演唱。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这个故事是个秘密，但是我还是知道了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你觉得来病房献殷勤，我们就能原谅你吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you think paying visits to the ward will make us forgive you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "李先生现在怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How is Mr Li doing now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "算你们命大，人救过来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Count yourselves lucky; the doctors revived him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is good news.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没有制止他胡乱吃药，那是我们的失误。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Failing to stop him taking pills carelessly was our oversight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但这不是他心脏病发的原因。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet that was not the cause of his heart attack.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我们的律师就在医院里等着呢，我们就是要告你们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our lawyers are waiting right here in the hospital, and we intend to sue you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "李铭基有舞台恐惧症。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Li Mingji suffers from stage fright.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你说什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you talking about?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他每次上台之前，你都会偷偷在台脚放一颗宝石。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before every performance, you secretly place a gemstone at the edge of the stage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让他看见宝石，他才会有信心完成演唱。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only when he sees that gem does he have the confidence to finish singing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这个故事是个秘密，但是我还是知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That story was a secret, yet I found out all the same.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你觉得来病房献殷勤，我们就能原谅你吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
