    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他每次上台之前，你都会偷偷在台脚放一颗宝石。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让他看见宝石，他才会有信心完成演唱。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这个故事是个秘密，但是我还是知道了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Yuqiao uncovers the artificial gemstone ritual that Li Mingji has relied on ever since his debut concert. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
